{
  "_comment": [
    "Cross-language contract fixture. The MCP chart tools accept a config from an agent and store it;",
    "the unify webapp is what has to draw it, and it validates only at draw time — so a config the two",
    "sides disagree about becomes an error message where a chart should be.",
    "",
    "Asserted from both sides:",
    "  server/compose/agentic/chart_handler_test.go  — parseChartConfig accepts/rejects these",
    "  lib/js/src/compose/types/chart/config-contract.test.ts — the renderer agrees, and throws the named key",
    "",
    "'rejected' configs are what agents actually sent before the MCP layer checked them. 'accepted' ones are",
    "already normalized (uppercase aggregate, explicit modifier), which is the shape the MCP layer stores.",
    "Defaulting and case-normalization are the MCP layer's own and are covered by its Go tests."
  ],

  "rejected": [
    {
      "name": "metric on a module field without an aggregate",
      "error": "missingMetricsAggregate",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "stage", "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)" }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "amount", "type": "bar" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "metric without a field",
      "error": "missingMetricsField",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "stage", "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)" }],
            "metrics": [{ "type": "bar" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "metric without a type",
      "error": "missingMetricsType",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "stage", "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)" }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "count" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dimension without a field",
      "error": "missingDimensionsField",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "modifier": "MONTH" }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "count", "type": "line" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "gauge metric whose dimension carries no steps",
      "error": "missingDimensionsSteps",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "stage", "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)" }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "count", "type": "gauge" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],

  "accepted": [
    {
      "name": "records counted, grouped by a Select field",
      "config": {
        "colorScheme": "tableau.Tableau10",
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "filter": "",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "stage", "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)", "conditions": {} }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "count", "type": "doughnut" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a numeric field summed over months",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "createdAt", "modifier": "MONTH" }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "amount", "aggregate": "SUM", "type": "bar" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "funnel",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [{ "field": "stage", "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)" }],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "count", "type": "funnel" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "gauge with its bands",
      "config": {
        "reports": [
          {
            "moduleID": "1",
            "dimensions": [
              {
                "field": "stage",
                "modifier": "(no grouping / buckets)",
                "meta": { "steps": [{ "value": 0 }, { "value": 50 }, { "value": 100 }] }
              }
            ],
            "metrics": [{ "field": "count", "type": "gauge" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
